{"license":"DANS Licence","fileAccessRequest":false,"metadataBlocks":{"citation":{"displayName":"Citation Metadata","name":"citation","fields":[{"typeName":"title","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Doorsnee Nederlanders in de Tweede Wereldoorlog - DNO"},{"typeName":"otherId","multiple":true,"typeClass":"compound","value":[{"otherIdValue":{"typeName":"otherIdValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"DNO"}},{"otherIdAgency":{"typeName":"otherIdAgency","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"DANS-KNAW"},"otherIdValue":{"typeName":"otherIdValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"easy-dataset:45138"}}]},{"typeName":"author","multiple":true,"typeClass":"compound","value":[{"authorName":{"typeName":"authorName","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"W.C. Ultee"}},{"authorName":{"typeName":"authorName","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Radboud Universiteit Nijmegen"}}]},{"typeName":"datasetContact","multiple":true,"typeClass":"compound","value":[{"datasetContactName":{"typeName":"datasetContactName","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"W.C.  Ultee"},"datasetContactAffiliation":{"typeName":"datasetContactAffiliation","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"radboud university nijmegen"}}]},{"typeName":"dsDescription","multiple":true,"typeClass":"compound","value":[{"dsDescriptionValue":{"typeName":"dsDescriptionValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"<p>Tussen 2006 en 2010 zijn door studenten van de Radboud Universiteit Nijmegen interviews afgenomen met personen die voor 1930 waren  geboren en tijdens de Tweede Wereldoorlog in Nederland woonden. De studenten begonnnen met interviewen bij grootouders en vonden door gebruik te maken van de sneeuwbalmethode andere respondenten die aan de vereiste criteria voldeden. De steekproef is herwogen naar de Nederlandse bevolking wat betreft godsdienst en woonprovincie tijdens de Tweede Wereldoorlog.<\/p><p>Het bestand omvat naast datafiles, ook audiofiles van de interviews. De SPSS files van de afzonderlijke jaren hebben als variable een interview ID en\/of respondentnummer  waarmee de  corresponderende audiofile met het interview gevonden kan worden. Niet van alle respondenten van een interview uit een bepaald jaar is overigens ook een audiofile beschikbaar.<br>De audiofiles kunnen niet gedownload worden, maar kunnen op verzoek bij DANS aangevraagd worden. Na toestemming van de oorspronkelijke onderzoeker worden de audiofiles separaat geleverd.<\/p>"}}]},{"typeName":"subject","multiple":true,"typeClass":"controlledVocabulary","value":["Arts and Humanities","Social Sciences"]},{"typeName":"keyword","multiple":true,"typeClass":"compound","value":[{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"oorlogsleed in de familie"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"kennis jodenvervolging"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"verzet"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"illegale pers"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"hongerwinter"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"arbeidsinzet"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"politionele acties"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"anti-duitse houdingen"}}]},{"typeName":"language","multiple":true,"typeClass":"controlledVocabulary","value":["Dutch"]},{"typeName":"productionDate","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"2010-01-01"},{"typeName":"distributionDate","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"2011-06-23"},{"typeName":"dateOfDeposit","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive",